      "title": "명령 검색",
      "desc": "버튼이나 Ctrl + K로 엽니다. 검색어를 입력하면 결과가 좁혀지고 Enter로 실행합니다.",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-btn\" data-variant=\"neutralWeak\" data-size=\"medium\" data-ds-open=\"ex-cmd\"><i class=\"ds-icon ds-icon--search\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>명령 찾기<kbd class=\"ds-command__kbd\" style=\"margin-left:var(--ds-space-x1)\">Ctrl K</kbd></button><dialog class=\"ds-command\" id=\"ex-cmd\" aria-label=\"명령 찾기\" data-ds-hotkey=\"k\"><div class=\"ds-command__search\"><i class=\"ds-icon ds-icon--search\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><input class=\"ds-command__input\" type=\"text\" role=\"combobox\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"ex-cmd-list\" aria-autocomplete=\"list\" placeholder=\"찾을 낱말\" aria-label=\"명령 찾기\"></div><div class=\"ds-command__list\" id=\"ex-cmd-list\" role=\"listbox\" aria-label=\"명령\"><div class=\"ds-command__group\" role=\"group\" aria-labelledby=\"ex-cmd-g0\"><p class=\"ds-command__title\" id=\"ex-cmd-g0\">이동</p><div class=\"ds-command__item\" role=\"option\" id=\"ex-cmd-0\" aria-selected=\"true\"><i class=\"ds-icon ds-icon--house\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><span class=\"ds-command__label\">홈</span><kbd class=\"ds-command__kbd\">H</kbd></div><div class=\"ds-command__item\" role=\"option\" id=\"ex-cmd-1\"><i class=\"ds-icon ds-icon--receipt\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><span class=\"ds-command__label\">주문 내역</span><kbd class=\"ds-command__kbd\">O</kbd></div><div class=\"ds-command__item\" role=\"option\" id=\"ex-cmd-2\"><i class=\"ds-icon ds-icon--settings\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><span class=\"ds-command__label\">설정</span><kbd class=\"ds-command__kbd\">S</kbd></div></div><div class=\"ds-command__group\" role=\"group\" aria-labelledby=\"ex-cmd-g1\"><p class=\"ds-command__title\" id=\"ex-cmd-g1\">동작</p><div class=\"ds-command__item\" role=\"option\" id=\"ex-cmd-3\"><i class=\"ds-icon ds-icon--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><span class=\"ds-command__label\">새 글 쓰기</span><kbd class=\"ds-command__kbd\">N</kbd></div><div class=\"ds-command__item\" role=\"option\" id=\"ex-cmd-4\"><i class=\"ds-icon ds-icon--download\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><span class=\"ds-command__label\">주문 내역 내려받기</span></div><div class=\"ds-command__item\" role=\"option\" id=\"ex-cmd-5\"><i class=\"ds-icon ds-icon--log-out\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><span class=\"ds-command__label\">로그아웃</span></div></div><p class=\"ds-command__empty\" hidden>찾는 명령이 없어요</p></div></dialog>"
    }
